      "reason": "real regression, fixed: the guest relay's combined shutdown(Both) is repeated by libkrun on its host socket, which on macOS fails with ENOTCONN after the client half-closes (measured), so two half-close cases saw no EOF until the 5 s proxy reaper; the relay again shuts Write then Read"
    },
    {
