  "remaining_limits": [
    "Fixed connection/deadline sample only: no aggregate memory bound under many sessions, no per-session output backpressure qualification, no adaptive or authenticated admission.",
    "The connection cap applies per keeper; a peer able to reach the socket can still hold all 16 slots for up to the 1 s deadline at a time.",
    "Quiescence covers this fixture's workspace/toolchain mounts and a TERM-ignoring writer; companion services, a process in uninterruptible sleep and host power loss are not qualified.",
    "Earlier density, preparation, workload, CLI/TLS, Remote-SSH and stop-receipt measurements keep their original keeper/guest hashes and are not transferred to these guests."
  ]
